{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56342","headline":"宿上霄洞居诗 · 袁吉","name":"宿上霄洞居诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一宿烟霞境，更无尘梦侵。\n泉声寒绕枕，山色冷归衾。\n自得希夷性，还忘名利心。\n更阑不成寐，岩鸟共寒吟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"袁吉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56342.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56342","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}